    "Once a day, Pluck asks GitHub whether a newer version exists. Nothing about you or your pictures is sent. Turn this off and Pluck never connects on its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Pluck asks GitHub whether a newer version exists. Nothing about you or your pictures is sent. Turn this off and Pluck never connects on its own."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pluck 每天向 GitHub 问一次有没有新版本，不会送出关于你或你的图片的任何东西。关掉它，Pluck 就不会自己联网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
